{"title":"결혼의 목적","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=fIJio/hAJrLJrRh1/cBCXG6vjknJOISrSrYZZtk&filename=th3","synopsis":"3년 사귄 남자친구의 바람, 10살 연상 이혼남과의 강제 맞선,\n그리고 자신만을 바라보는 숨 막히는 가족들을 경제적으로 책임져야 하는 윤설영에게 처해진 현실은 가혹하기만 하다.\n\n답답한 현실에서 벗어나고 싶다고 생각한 순간,\n신화그룹의 전무이자 지나치게 깔끔한 사생활로 게이라고 소문이 난 기태환이 설영에게 다가온다.\n\n“나하고 결혼합시다. 더 높은 곳에 데려가줄게요.”\n\n하루아침에 신화그룹 전무실 비서에서 며느리가 된 설영!\n그리고 태환이 설영에게 제안한 이 결혼의 진짜 목적은?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":270,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":271,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":208,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":245,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":244,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":255,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":234,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":293,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":267,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":238,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":264,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-